     188702,1501 Evans Ave,37.7422086702947,-122.387293152263
 
+Transforming rows before inserting them
+---------------------------------------
+
+The ``--convert`` option can execute Python code against each incoming JSON
+object before it is inserted. The object is available as ``row`` and can be
+modified in place. Every input object will still be inserted::
+
+    $ echo '{"n": "1"}\n{"n": "2"}' | \
+        sqlite-utils insert numbers.db numbers - --nl \
+        --convert 'row["n"] = int(row["n"]) + 1'
+
